<title>USA: ArQule extends collaboration with Abbott.</title>
<headline>ArQule extends collaboration with Abbott.</headline>
<dateline>MEDFORD, Mass. 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>ArQule Inc said Tuesday it has extended its agreement with Abbott Laboratories to use ArQule products to help develop new drug compounds.</p>
<p>Under the original June 1995 agreement, ArQule provides Mapping Array and Directed Array compound sets to Abbott to help identify and develop potential new drugs to treat various diseases. That agreement, which ran through June 1997, is now extended through March 1999.</p>
</text>
